// EXPECTED-UNTRANSLATABLE — both sides are bare variables: neither side can
// anchor a match (a lone-variable pattern matches every e-class; egglog
// rejects it as ungrounded, and the variables are mutually unbound besides).
// provenance: G14 adapter self-suite (2026-08-12)
equivalence rename_only {
    x
    <=>
    y
}
